src/tables.rs holds the Huffman codebooks, scalefactor band offsets and TNS
band limits defined by ISO/IEC 14496-3. They were transcribed by a script from
FFmpeg's libavcodec/aactab.c:

    Copyright (c) 2005-2006 Oded Shimon
    Copyright (c) 2006-2007 Maxim Gavrilov

which is licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or
later. As section 3 of that licence allows, they are used here under the terms
of the GNU General Public License, version 3, and combined with this work under
the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or later.

Everything else was written for this project from the published descriptions
of MPEG-2/4 AAC Low Complexity and checked against FFmpeg's decoder output.

tests/data holds short streams encoded by FFmpeg from synthetic test tones and
FFmpeg's own decoding of them, used as reference output.
